21p1|n|A goatlike animal (Capra Jemlaica) native of the Himalayas. It has small, flattened horns, curved directly backward. The hair of the neck, shoulders, and chest of the male is very long, reaching to the knees. Called also serow, and imo. ; It needs; need.	a:243w,114,27~243w,114,27	v:21y5,44,3~21y5,44,3
21pk|n|The melting of ice, snow, or other congealed matter; the resolution of ice, or the like, into the state of a fluid; liquefaction by heat of anything congealed by frost; also, a warmth of weather sufficient to melt that which is congealed.	v:t9y,50,1~t9y,50,1	n:t9y,70,4~t9y,70,4	N:hfg,59,4;1mck,40,1~hfg,59,4;1mck,40,1
