224y|a|Going or extending through; going, extending, or serving from the beginning to the end; thorough; complete; as, a through line; a through ticket; a through train. Also, admitting of passage through; as, a through bridge.	j:zb0,3,1;10ol,2,1~zb0,3,1;10ol,2,1
